  "body": "An outstanding opportunity to secure a fully serviced multi-housing development site with building plans, and motivated, supportive landowner ready to work with builders.\r\n\r\nMaster Planned subdivision lead by reputable CKL team finished with Premium infrastructure - Top quality landscape & services, wide streets and access ways.\r\n\r\n89 Sunnyheights Road: \r\n\r\n2621m2 super lot for building 10 standalone homes (Sub lot 17 - lot 26)\r\n\r\nLots 17-25, a range of land sizes from 230m2 - 279m2 - house size 231m2 - 4 bedrooms + 2 bedroom studio (2 kitchens)\r\n\r\nLot 26, land size 328m2 - house size 186 - 4 bedrooms + 2 bathrooms\r\n\r\nFull serviced with Waste water, stormwater, water, power to the each sub lot boundary.\r\n\r\nElevated site with views enjoys a peaceful setting with open surroundings.\r\n\r\nNext to Nukumea Primary School, green reserves and only minutes to Orewa Beach shops and cafes, this is a rare chance to secure this multiple housing parcel in a high-demand location.\r\n\r\nSecure your slice of Orewa and unlock the potential.",
